  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "copperleaf_meeting_open",
      "speaker": "copperleaf",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Copperleaf. Route keeper, occasional umbrella rack. That last part is a misunderstanding about my spines.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not_flag": "met_copperleaf"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "met_copperleaf",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "copperleaf_meeting_question"
    },
    {
      "id": "copperleaf_meeting_question",
      "speaker": "copperleaf",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "I am checking the covered walk. What would help you feel welcome on an unfamiliar path?",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_copperleaf"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Knowing where it leads.",
          "next": "copperleaf_meeting_value_1"
        },
        {
          "text": "A place to stop.",
          "next": "copperleaf_meeting_value_2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Someone to walk with.",
          "next": "copperleaf_meeting_value_3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "copperleaf_meeting_value_1",
      "speaker": "copperleaf",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Then the card should say so plainly. A beautiful arrow pointing nowhere is merely an ambitious leaf.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_copperleaf"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "copperleaf_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "copperleaf_meeting_value_2",
      "speaker": "copperleaf",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Quite. A route without a resting place is only half described. I am adding the other half.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_copperleaf"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "copperleaf_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "copperleaf_meeting_value_3",
      "speaker": "copperleaf",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "I can manage that. My pace includes looking at things and the occasional disagreement with my folio strap.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_copperleaf"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": "copperleaf_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "copperleaf_meeting_close",
      "speaker": "copperleaf",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Find me along the covered walk. If I am standing still, that may be part of the route inspection.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_copperleaf"
        }
      ],
      "effects": []
    },
    {
      "id": "copperleaf_greeting_dawn_clear",
      "speaker": "copperleaf",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Clear dawn. The covered walk is still useful. Shade is shelter with different weather.",
